{"id":"b4c8e863bb75986f","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-hereditary-size-class.md","title":"ZFC Hereditary Size Class","display":"df-zfc-hereditary-size-class — ZFC Hereditary Size Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-hereditary-size-class","aliases":["58-df-zfc-hereditary-size-class"],"display":"df-zfc-hereditary-size-class — ZFC Hereditary Size Class","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-set9-h-kappa.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-hereditary-size-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-hereditary-size-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-hereditary-size-class — ZFC Hereditary Size Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"433e9516a72135ee\" href=\"?note=433e9516a72135ee\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-set9-h-kappa.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-set9-h-kappa.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\kappa,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(H_\\kappa,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> is as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet9HKappa}_S:V\\rightharpoonup V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet9HKappa}_S:V\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span> is the rank-bounded hereditary-size operator from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"433e9516a72135ee\" href=\"?note=433e9516a72135ee\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-set9-h-kappa.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-set9-h-kappa.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HereditarySizeClass}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{HereditarySizeClass}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}hereditary\\text{-}size\\text{-}class} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{HereditarySizeClass}_S(H_\\kappa,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\nH_\\kappa=\\mathrm{ZfcSet9HKappa}_S(\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}hereditary\\text{-}size\\text{-}class} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{HereditarySizeClass}_S(H_\\kappa,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\nH_\\kappa=\\mathrm{ZfcSet9HKappa}_S(\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The canonical operator bounds its comprehension by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_{\\kappa^+}\">\\(V_{\\kappa^+}\\)</span>, so <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_\\kappa\">\\(H_\\kappa\\)</span> is explicitly a set rather than a class comprehension over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-set9-h-kappa.md","status":"resolved","id":"433e9516a72135ee","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-set9-h-kappa.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ is as in [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]].","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-set9-h-kappa.md","status":"resolved","id":"433e9516a72135ee","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcSet9HKappa}_S:V\\rightharpoonup V$ is the rank-bounded hereditary-size operator from [[../batch05/58-df-zfc-set9-h-kappa.md]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"H_\\kappa,\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet9HKappa}_S:V\\rightharpoonup V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HereditarySizeClass}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}hereditary\\text{-}size\\text{-}class} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{HereditarySizeClass}_S(H_\\kappa,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\nH_\\kappa=\\mathrm{ZfcSet9HKappa}_S(\\kappa)","display":true},{"tex":"V_{\\kappa^+}","display":false},{"tex":"H_\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":1067,"backlinks":[{"id":"962458a3ee31cc8f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HereditarySizeClass}_S$, $\\prec_{\\mathcal L_\\in}$, $\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$, and $\\approx$ are as in [[./58-df-zfc-hereditary-size-class.md]], [[../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md]], [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]], and [[../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md]]."},{"id":"e0902736e45e6217","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HereditarySizeClass}_S(H,\\theta)$（$H=H_\\theta$，见 [[../batch14/58-df-zfc-hereditary-size-class.md]]）"},{"id":"b45f5f010e335696","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HereditarySizeClass}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch14/58-df-zfc-hereditary-size-class.md]])"},{"id":"1a4afb459225c46e","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HereditarySizeClass}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (hereditary-size-class predicate, see [[../batch14/58-df-zfc-hereditary-size-class.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2265","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-hereditary-size-class.md|58-df-zfc-hereditary-size-class]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["5fb1c2241d1943d1","433e9516a72135ee"]}